tive Edge Parties"], "formula_4": "[detailed_scene_description] (best practice)", "examples": ["Our team celebrated alongside some of our favorite people in the industry for white party at our venue"]}, "avg_length": {"logo_alt": "15-25 characters", "photo_alt": "40-120 characters", "recommended_min": "40 characters", "recommended_max": "125 characters"}, "keywords_included": ["catering", "event", "wedding", "corporate", "food", "gourmet", "fresh", "professional", "service", "venue", "reception", "celebration", "party", "dinner", "buffet"], "best_practices_identified": ["Include specific context (venue type, event type)", "Mention food items when visible", "Add emotional descriptors (beautiful, elegant, festive)", "Describe setting/location when relevant", "Keep under 125 characters for accessibility", "Avoid keyword stuffing", "Be specific rather than generic"], "common_issues_found": ["Brand name only alts (lazy SEO)", "Missing alt texts entirely", "Too generic ('image', 'photo')", "Overly long descriptions (>200 chars)", "Keyword-stuffed alts that don't describe image"]}, "meta_descriptions": {"by_page_type": {"homepage": [{"site": "concordecatering", "text": "Concorde Catering is brought to you by the culinary team behind your favourite Calgary restaurants. From holiday parties and weddings to special events and corporate gatherings, we work with budgets big and small to bring any event to life.", "length": 227, "has_cta": false, "keywords": ["Calgary", "restaurants", "weddings", "corporate", "events"], "unique_value_proposition": "culinary team behind favourite Calgary restaurants, works with budgets big and small"}, {"site": "ridgewells", "text": "Ridgewells Catering has been the go-to choice for catering in Washington, D.C. for more than 95 years. Corporate Events, Weddings, Social Events, Major Sporting Events, and all-around Impeccable Hospitality. Award winning culinary team and voted best caterer in Washington DC.", "length": 268, "has_cta": false, "keywo